  "description": "Discord \nhttps://discord.gg/WKAQHyKQ\n\n🎉 Welcome to Heavan, a place where progress never sleeps and the skies are the limit. We are a laid-back but goal-driven guild focused on growing together through cooperation, strategy, and consistency — all while enjoying the idle grind. \n\n⚔️ Guild raid timing ( 10 time zones to understand for all ) \n\nUTC (Coordinated Universal Time): 3:00 AM\n\nEST (Eastern Standard Time): 11:00 PM (previous day)\n\nPST (Pacific Standard Time): 8:00 PM (previous day)\n\nCST (Central Standard Time): 10:00 PM (previous day)\n\nBST (British Summer Time): 4:00 AM\n\nCET (Central European Time): 5:00 AM\n\nJST (Japan Standard Time): 12:00 PM\n\nAEST (Australian Eastern Standard Time): 1:30 PM\n\nMSK (Moscow Standard Time): 6:00 AM\n\nSGT (Singapore Time): 11:00 AM\n\n\n📌 Whether you&#039;re a seasoned adventurer or a fresh recruit still figuring out how to smelt coal without burning your fingers, you’ll find a home here.\n\n📍What We Offer:\n\n✴️Active Community: Friendly and supportive members to answer questions, share tips, and team up for bosses or dungeons.\n\n✴️Growth-Focused: We celebrate all kinds of progression — combat, crafting, gathering, and forging.\n\n✴️Events &amp; Goals: Weekly guild goals, friendly competitions, and long-term planning.\n\n✴️Flexible Activity: We understand life happens. Whether you check in daily or prefer to set your actions and AFK, you&#039;re welcome — consistency matters more than grind speed.\n\n✴️Leadership Support: Active leadership that helps organize, upgrade, and guide the guild to the top of the leaderboard — without toxic pressure.\n\n\n📌Who We’re Looking For:\n\n✨Players who want a chill yet productive guild.\n\n✨Willing to contribute to guild upgrades over time.\n\n✨Enjoy teamwork, strategy, and good conversation (chat optional but appreciated).\n\n✨All skill levels welcome.\n\n📜Rule:\n\n📍Inactivity over 7–10 days may result in removal (unless notified).\n\n\n✴️Join Heavan — where you can idle with purpose and rise with friends.✴️",
